damaged_code:
```rust
fn lock(&self) {
    while self.busy {
        // Spin
    }
    self.busy = true;
}
```

fix:
Use a single atomic Compare-And-Swap (CAS) step:
```rust
fn lock(&self) {
    while self.busy.compare_exchange(false, true, Ordering::Acquire, Ordering::Relaxed).is_err() {
        // Spin
    }
}
```
